# token-usage

- Entry point: `./scripts/token_usage.sh` (doctor / collect / push / install /
  status / test). Do not add a second wrapper.
- Python collectors are stdlib-only. No pip deps.
- Never commit or print API keys, `CURSOR_TOKEN`, JWTs, or
  `~/.config/token-usage/env`.
- Cursor: `GET /api/usage-summary` → compact `plan` / `onDemand` in
  `data/cursor.json`. `/api/usage?user=` is fallback only. Launchd is local
  (`~/Library/LaunchAgents/`), not checked in.
- Provider errors are `ok: false` snapshots. Fail the process only when
  auth/config is missing.
- Dashboard is vanilla `index.html` + `assets/js/app.js`.
- Code PRs: Luna + Bugbot + security review before merge.
